## ⚙️ Installation and Setup

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/kinkirisandhya2005-pixel/my-project.git
```

### 2. Navigate to the Project

```bash
cd my-project
```

### 3. Setup Backend

```bash
cd backend
npm install
```

Start the backend server:

```bash
node server.js
```

### 4. Setup Frontend

Open another terminal and run:

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
```

Start the frontend:

```bash
npm run dev
```

The application will be available at the local URL displayed by Vite, usually:

```text
http://localhost:5173
```

